sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server
    C->>S: CONNECT
    S-->>C: ACK
    loop every 10 s
        C->>S: PING
        S-->>C: PONG
    end
    alt checksum ok
        C->>S: DATA
        S-->>C: DATA_ACK
    else checksum failed
        S-->>C: NACK
    end
    C->>S: DISCONNECT
